<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Durban Deep says buys rest of West Wits.</title>
<headline>Durban Deep says buys rest of West Wits.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mining firm Durban Roodepoort Deep Ltd said on Thursday that it had compulsorily acquired the remaining ordinary shares, preferred shares and options in West Witwatersrand Gold Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The listing of West Wits on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange will now be terminated with effect from Friday, November 22.</p>
<p>Durban Deep circulated its offer to West Wits shareholders on August 12.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
